      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 15,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 800
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 900
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] There! Another carriage with no horse... eyes of fire, rolling past my hill as if it owned the night."
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 14,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 600
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 10,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 1500
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 1700
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] [scoffs] In my day a carriage had the decency to be pulled. Who drives these? Ghosts? Merchants? Worse?"
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 500
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 12,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 1200
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "goblin-video",
        "goblinName": "Goblin 2",
        "videoId": "Pha Wraith Unholyhovering Win H.mp4",
        "waitMs": 0,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 13,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 1400
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] Look to the big window, traveller. Whatever rides inside those carriages does not stop here. Not while I stand."
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 14,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 1500
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 11,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 2000
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 2200
      },
      {
        "type": "fleet-say",
        "node": "Orlok",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] [chuckles] Carriages, Dragomir? They are called cars. Bună seara, old friend."
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 800
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 16,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 300
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 17,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 300
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 18,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 700
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 800
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] Cars. Bah. The Count grows soft. Carriage, I say. Go up and tell him the bar holds... and watch his face."
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 14,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 800
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
