    "name": "Sir Dragomir: Old Steel for the Lady Below",
    "description": "Story (~70 s): ghostly music; he turns toward the keep, swears his old oath over the lady in the depths, a floating lady crosses the clearest screen, and Mina whispers back.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "fleet-mode",
        "mode": "hold",
        "node": "Sir Dragomir",
        "maxMs": 140000,
