      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] Hush. Below this hill, in oak and iron, the lady sleeps. I barred the keep door with my own hand."
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 700
      },
      {
        "type": "goblin-video",
