      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 1600
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] [softly] You heard her. The night is quiet. Go down to the wall, speak softly, and ask Lady Mina what she dreamed."
      },
