      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 900
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] A riddle, traveller. I stand without legs, I watch without eyes, and I fall only once. What am I?"
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 500
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 20,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 3000
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3200
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 6,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 1500
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 1700
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 11,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 3000
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 3200
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 14,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 400
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 13,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] A wall. Bine. I stood on one in fourteen sixty-two, beside a giant who threw rocks."
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 500
      },
      {
        "type": "goblin-video",
        "goblinName": "Goblin 2",
        "videoId": "Pha Wraith Riseofthewraiths Win H.mp4",
        "waitMs": 0,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "goblin-video",
        "goblinName": "Goblin 3",
        "videoId": "Bigskull.mp4",
        "waitMs": 0,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 10,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 3000
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 1000
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] The army came up the valley like a sea of torches. We threw everything we had. We held."
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 400
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 12,
        "options": {
          "transitionDurationMs": 600
        },
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 700
      },
      {
        "type": "sayThis",
        "text": "[Romanian accent] [shouts] PENTRU ȚARĂ! For the country!"
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 16,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 500
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 17,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 400
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
        "poseId": 14,
        "concurrent": true
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 600
      },
      {
        "type": "fleet-say",
        "node": "Groundbreaker",
        "text": "ROCKS! GROUNDBREAKER THREW BIG ROCKS! KNIGHT REMEMBERS! GROUNDBREAKER REMEMBERS TOO!"
      },
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "duration": 800
      },
      {
        "type": "pose",
